# ==============================================================================
# Paketmätningssystem V3 — Git Ignore
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Byte-compiled / Python-genererade filer
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# 2. Virtuella miljöer (Python venv)
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
matsystem-env/

# 3. Editorer & Operativsystem
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo

# 4. Lokala mätdata, loggar och testbilder (förhindrar tunga binärfiler i Git)
*.log
logs/
test_images/
captures/
output/
scratch/
recordings/

# 5. Lokala maskinspecifika konfigurationer
*.local.json

# 6. Intern affärsdokumentation, budget & personliga strategier (aldrig till GitHub)
internal/
private/
notes/
*BUDGET*
*budget*
*BUSINESS*
*business*
*IDEAS*
*ideas*
*.notes.md
